    "body": "Work stopped. No fix is ready for a pull request.\n\nThe motion pins fail before the change and pass after the local change. Each mutation fails its matching pin.\n\nThe app test finds RapidInStock at move 1. The stock top is 0.508 mm above the hole top. A rapid to the hole top plus 0.1 mm enters uncut stock. The stock simulation did not run because verification failed first.\n\nThe first entry needs the stock material height. CircularParams does not carry that height. The operation generator has the stock height in run_job_arms in crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs. Open PR #1713 changes that same function. The worker instructions require a stop for this overlap.\n\nThe claim is released. The incomplete patch stays in local worktree .claude/worktrees/issue-1807 on issue/1807-circular-stay-down. It has no commit and no push. The quick gate and clippy did not run. Do not use the local height cap as a complete fix.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
